PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above and the grounds raised hereinabove, the Applicant most respectfully prays that this Hon'ble Tribunal may graciously be pleased to:

a) Quash and set aside the impugned order dated {impugned_order_date} passed by the Respondent No.___ in {impugned_order_no};

b) Direct the Respondents to {consequential_relief — promote / restore / reinstate / pay arrears / regularise / grant pension etc.} with all consequential service benefits including notional / actual pay fixation, arrears with interest, continuity of service and seniority;

c) Pending hearing and final disposal of the present Original Application, stay the operation and effect of the impugned order dated {impugned_order_date};

d) Award costs of the present Original Application;

e) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Tribunal may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the Applicant shall ever pray.
